WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.240
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.240
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:09.180
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:09.180
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:19.750
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.690
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.710
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.710
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.150
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.150
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.920
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.920
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.200
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.200
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.640
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.640
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:45.230
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:45.230
it waits nearby.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:49.690
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:49.690
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.760
I can say love

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.490
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.490
It overflows with love.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.490
will you love me?

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:57.100
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:57.100
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.050
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.050
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.610
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.610
The shape of your love,

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:08.260
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:08.260
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:25.080
A- Amane-sensei!

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:27.260
What do you mean?!

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:28.600
Precisely what I said.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.630
But what does it mean?

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.070
You're living with me while you
undergo your body enhancement training.

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:35.970
But why do I have to live with you?!

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.810
You don't like the idea?

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:43.230
You don't like the idea of living with me?

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:48.690
N-No, it's not about me not liking the idea...

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:52.150
Even though it is for my training, I-I am a boy...

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:54.320
So, it's like, not good to...

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:57.660
It's not good, not good!

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:56.280
Seina-kun.

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:58.660
Seina-kun.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:01:59.990
K-Kiriko-san!

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:01.370
What's not good?

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.680
Oh, nothing! Nothing at all!

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.660
Amane-san and I were just...

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:06.670
Hey!

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.200
What are you doing?

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:11.000
Let's hurry and get your luggage so we can–

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.710
Kiriko-san, I'm in a hurry!

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:15.600
S-See you later!

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:25.020
Living Together

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:29.400
You don't need to do anything special
after undergoing body enhancement.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.860
Daily, routine life is the best training there is.

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:36.640
So being with your instructor
during that time is best for you.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:40.370
Can't I just stay in my dorm
room if daily life is best?

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:42.740
You want your roommates
to take care of you?

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:46.080
You'd only bother them that way,
what with your diaper and all.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.120
Diaper?

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:48.950
This.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:53.610
You can't even walk on your own,
which makes you like a helpless baby.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:57.990
Tennan-sensei!

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.560
Ah, Amane. It's been a while.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:02.390
And I was just getting used
to not having you around.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:05.020
Forgive me for making you feel lonely.

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:08.130
I've been quite busy with work, you see...

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:12.520
I've just returned from my classified
assignment with Mitoto-sama.

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:17.030
Oh? And who might this be?

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:19.180
Ah, yes, now I remember.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:22.680
You're the student who takes forever
to finish my exercise routines,

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.620
Yamada Seina-kun.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.150
Is it really okay for you
to be riding in that thing?

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:32.360
You'll never get out of your diaper if
you don't start with walking practice!

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.250
Right, Amane?!

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:34.460
Seina-kun.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:37.880
After we get your bags at the dorm
we'll be going straight to my house.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.930
Make sure you don't forget anything, okay?

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:40.890
No way...

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:42.970
No! You can't do that!

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:46.540
I absolutely will not allow
you to live with this clod!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:47.310
Yamada Seina!

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.280
Using your position as a student
to fool a female instructor

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.270
into giving you personal
instruction is utterly despicable!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.480
No, it wasn't really up to me...

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.780
I, Tennan Seiryo, will put my pride on the line

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:00.990
and make sure to it that
you'll never disgrace my Amane!

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.750
"M-My Amane"?

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.460
Hey, Amane, what are you doing?!

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.580
Hey, Seina, get away from her!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.890
Hey! Hey! Why the...!?

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:15.630
The ocean!

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.380
U-Um, Amane-sensei...

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.180
Don't worry about it,
this happens all the time.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.240
All the time?

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.250
But, is it really all right?

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:27.180
Is what all right?

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:29.810
He called you his Amane, so...

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:35.250
The person who believes a fool's
nonsense is even more foolish.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:39.030
Outside of class, you don't need
to listen to a thing he says.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.400
R-Right...

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:44.700
Oh, yes. Your room isn't
very big, I hope that's okay.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.370
Oh, that's fine.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:48.790
But do I really have to go?

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:52.810
I just moved in so there's
not much inside yet.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.140
But I'm especially fond of the bath.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:57.180
It has the greatest view!

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.880
It's a little small,

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:02.510
but should be big enough for two people to get in!

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.890
T-Two people?

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.950
Hello, Seina-kun!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.890
H-Hello!

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:11.760
Amane-san, I'm done here. How about you?

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:13.430
We'll be at his dorm room soon.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.060
I don't think it'll be too long.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.330
Roger.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.070
Well, see you soon, Seina-kun!

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:19.830
O-Okay...

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:20.570
Something the matter?

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.240
N-No...

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:24.070
Was Elma-san doing something?

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:26.410
She said she finished moving
all her baggage to my house!

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.140
We better hurry too!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:28.870
Your house?

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:32.620
Did you think it was going to
be just you and me, all alone?

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:47.430
But Seina's just put his diaper on,
so it's our duty to take care of him!

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.860
That's right!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:53.560
Both you and Elma-san are
already extremely busy as it is!

00:05:54.970 --> 00:06:00.170
You must be close friends with Seina-kun
if you're that concerned for him.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.370
That's right!

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:03.860
So please, let us live with you too!

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:08.120
Thanks. But you have your own
classes to attend, don't you?

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.870
You could give us personal instruction!

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:12.890
I really appreciate your offer.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.960
When Seina-kun finishes adjusting
to his new body and comes back,

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:18.420
you can take care of him then.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.890
B-But then there's no point in–

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:23.830
Well, I'll see you in class.

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:31.100
I already turned in a note saying
that we're not staying in the dorms...

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.540
Those are some pretty
good friends you got there.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.770
Y-Yeah...

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:41.010
They might've been even better
friends had they been sincere, though.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.650
You could tell what they were up to?

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.480
Of course I could.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.920
I am a detective, you know.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:52.410
And with those obvious looks on
their faces, anybody could tell.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.710
If so,

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.270
then the same goes for me too.

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:02.000
There's no knowing what I might do...

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.870
Go ahead and try, if you think you can.

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:08.160
I'd be really impressed if you
managed to do anything at all...

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.210
A-Amane-sensei...

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:14.050
Besides, weren't you
the one who screamed at me

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.830
about how it was my fault you weren't promoted?

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.880
So why...

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:21.480
Seeing you with your diaper on trying
to walk is more than enough for me!

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.320
And besides, it looks like things
are just about to get interesting...

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.720
We can't go back to the dorms tonight,

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:35.500
and there's no other place to go...

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.470
Kenneth-kun, what are we going to do?

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:42.290
Shut up!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:46.050
What's going to happen to us now?

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:48.050
There's nothing for us.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:50.340
Our ship is wasted...

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.600
I guess it's terrestrial work for us...

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:57.770
Goodbye, my Ryoko!

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:05.610
This is all that Seina's fault!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.540
H-Hello!

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:31.920
What're you doing? Let's go.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.770
R-Right...

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:38.600
Um, is this your house, Amane-sensei?

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.020
Of course not.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.570
It's simply our second house.

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:43.480
Second house?!

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.910
That's right. They're making
me an instructor, right?

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:48.570
So I bought it because it's closer to work.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.740
What's the matter, Seina-kun?

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.050
Hurry inside!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.120
O-Okay...

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:59.620
Is this really her second house?

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.120
You mean you didn't know?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:04.820
Amane-san is the daughter
of the Kaunaq family!

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:08.630
I heard that from Kenneth and Rajau,
but who is the Kaunaq family?

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:12.370
They have the trendiest
high-quality clothing brand!

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:14.890
Its popularity probably
hasn't reached Earth, though...

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:16.270
Step inside.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:16.890
Okay...

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:23.770
So Kaunaq is a pretty famous brand outside Earth?

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:23.770
Hi!

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:27.690
This way, Seina-kun.

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:33.490
What's more, Amane-san was a really
famous supermodel for Kaunaq.

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:35.470
This is nothing to her!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:38.520
Why did someone like that join the GP?

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.910
Well, she and her father are...

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.760
Elma, you're letting your
mouth get ahead of you.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.250
Eh? Oh, right...

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.470
Well? Do you like it?

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:51.260
Yeah...

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:56.040
Um, I thought you said it wasn't very big.

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.340
This isn't all that big, wouldn't you agree?

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:00.220
We're going shopping in a bit,

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:03.280
so it'll get even smaller once we get back.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.060
Smaller... Yeah...

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:08.400
My entire house could fit in here.

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:11.150
It gets a decent amount of sunlight,

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:13.460
but the view makes up for it!

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:20.470
Our other roommate is finally here!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.450
Our other roommate?!

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.730
O-Our other roommate...

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:50.610
is you, Kiriko-san?

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:53.500
Oh? You didn't know?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.780
Kiriko is your legal guardian here,

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:59.840
so she has a duty to look
after you in this situation.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.830
Please treat me well, Seina-chan.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.610
L-Likewise...

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:09.580
Seina-kun, you didn't act
that way when I greeted you...

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:11.720
N-No, I'm not really–

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:13.210
But guess what, Elma?

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:17.820
Apparently Seina-kun thought he and I
would be living together, all alone.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.360
He was so excited he couldn't control himself...

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.190
Oh, really?

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:23.640
No, uh...

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:26.560
Hey now, there's no time for that.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.440
Yeah, yeah...

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:31.440
By the way, I've been meaning
to ask you for a while now,

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.610
but what exactly is your job, Kiriko?!

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:38.240
This is a Deep-Space Core Unit Cruiser.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:41.880
No ordinary GP officers have this sort of thing!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.850
I'm only borrowing it from Airi-sama
because there's been no use for it lately.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:48.250
Plus, it doesn't have its deep-space unit.

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:51.190
At any rate, we need to
tell him about ''it,'' right?

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.750
Security shouldn't be a problem
as this is Airi-sama's ship.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:04.060
So all those computer
problems were my fault?

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:05.740
Don't be so hard on yourself.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:09.980
Just because your personal data caused
it doesn't mean you're responsible.

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:10.980
Okay...

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:12.980
But don't tell this to anyone else.

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:15.850
This is considered top secret
 even within the academy,

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:16.920
so be careful.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.780
With as much trouble as you caused,

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.200
you're lucky you made it out with
what little punishment you got!

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:24.660
Well, in effect, he did help find
a number of undiscovered viruses

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:28.260
and bugs in the philosophy
server's security system!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.340
On the other hand,

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:31.620
weren't you docked pay
 and given the job of studying

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.710
Seina-chan's unique probabilistic irregularities?

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:37.920
I'm interested in his probabilistic
irregularities anyway,

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.630
so I don't mind!

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:43.910
Good timing! It looks
like we've arrived!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.520
Arrived?

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:47.470
You mean the ship moved?

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.310
Yes, almost immediately after we got on.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:54.170
We could have everything transported
straight to Amane's house,

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:57.220
but that wouldn't be very fun, so
that's why we came here to shop!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:00.010
That part of you is very Earthling-like, Kiriko.

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:04.160
Even though transporting them to the
ship or my house would be better...

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.200
Oh, come on...

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:09.290
Say, let's go choose daily household items first!

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:12.770
Earthlings sure are difficult.

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:13.670
They are...

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.580
This looks good, but this one
doesn't look too bad either...

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:21.610
Which do you prefer, Seina-chan?

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:22.780
Either one is...

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.440
Don't give me that!

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:27.050
You're going to use it too, so choose one!

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.050
O-Okay...

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:30.290
But still, I'm not sure...

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.520
What?!

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:35.260
You're practically acting
like a newlywed, Kiriko...

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:37.990
I-I wasn't trying to...

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:39.110
Right?

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.130
Um, no, uh...

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:45.100
Do you think so too, Seina-chan?

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:48.120
No, I can't really...

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.080
Oh my, why are you blushing, Seina-chan?

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.040
S-Sorry!

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:57.080
Say, Seina-kun, what kind
of bath powder do you like?

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.690
Aromatherapy isn't just
for mental relaxation.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:05.260
There are other kinds that do
the opposite and arouse you.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.660
Seina, what do you say we
go check out the bathrobes?

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.110
I'll let you choose mine.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:15.830
Or do you prefer nothing at all?

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.770
Um, I...

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:20.410
We're still in the middle of choosing shampoo!

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:22.540
I'll choose the perfumes and bathrobes!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.340
Kiriko's mean, isn't she?

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.240
For sure!

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.550
M-Mean?!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.610
Seina-chan doesn't think so!

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:29.620
But you are mean.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:33.720
I've been giving him baths
since he was a child!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.790
So I know everything about him!

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:39.390
You know...

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:40.810
...everything?

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:44.960
Maybe ''everything'' is a
bit of an exaggeration.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:47.990
Uh, how do I put this...

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.300
Say, Seina-kun,

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:53.570
let's find out everything
about each other too.

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:58.280
Yeah, we're all living under
the same roof, after all.

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.190
That is unacceptable, Amane!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.220
I got the feeling you'd show up.

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:05.070
I'll never stop coming back!

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:10.030
I, Tennan Seiryo, will do whatever
it takes to win you over, Amane!

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.580
I guess dumping him into the
ocean wasn't hint enough...

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:16.430
Hear me out. I, too, am a highly
esteemed member of the GP.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.460
As such, I am fully aware that
I must treat superior students,

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:22.670
and not-so-superior students, equally.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:26.410
However, isn't it true that superior
instructors such as yourself

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:30.380
should only teach superior students?!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:33.180
Luckily, Yamada Seina
also has Masaki-sensei,

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:36.720
who chose of her own accord
to be his legal guardian.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:37.580
That's not–

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.020
You just don't get it!

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:40.690
Give it up, will ya?!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:45.530
After all, Seina and I are
already at the kissing stage!

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:50.130
There you have it!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:50.910
So...

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:52.830
Get lost!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:53.780
Trash!

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:02.040
That felt great.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.610
S-Seina-chan! You ki-kissed her?!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.310
I didn't do anything!

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:09.430
Oh, how awful! You mean you forgot?

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:14.220
Remember when we first met?

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.470
When you first met?!

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:19.330
I did it for you, remember?

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:22.360
CPR...

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:35.700
What are the two of you
blushing bright red for?

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:40.210
Seina-kun.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:45.670
That was my first kiss, you know.

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:53.840
Don't be so angry, Kiriko-chan!

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:56.260
I am not angry.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.500
This'll be my treat, so cheer up!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:00.270
I'm not mad!

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:04.200
Oh, Seina-kun. I sure would like some water.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:06.650
Could you ask the old
lady to bring us some?

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:07.970
Uh, sure...

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:09.150
Wait, Amane...

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:10.940
It'll be all right.

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:13.910
Seina-kun, the old lady
here can't hear very well,

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:18.020
so she won't hear you unless you yell,
''Old lady!'' to her really loud.

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:19.580
Okay...

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:20.540
S-Seina-chan!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.040
U-Um...

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:27.040
Excuse me, old lady, could I get some water?!

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.590
Old lady?!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:34.890
Amane-sensei...

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:37.740
is happy...?

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.620
U-Um...

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.840
Did you just call me an old lady?

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:43.390
You called me an old lady, didn't you?

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.570
'I will never call her an old lady again...'

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.570
'I will never call her an old lady again...'

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.570
'I will never call her an old lady again...'

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.570
'I will never call her an old lady again...'

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:49.050
This is mean!

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:50.070
What is?

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:53.820
But why is the chairwoman
working at a small restaurant?

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.840
I don't work here.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.990
I'm here because I owe a friend a favor.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:00.090
And besides, cooking is my hobby.

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:00.700
Your hobby?

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:04.890
A long time ago,

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.630
I was told you could live anywhere,

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:10.270
as long as you knew
how to cook good food.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.450
Ever since then,

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.060
no matter how busy I get,

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:15.180
I still find time to cook.

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:18.180
Okay, you can stop now.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:20.440
Your food should be ready soon,

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:22.520
so go choose a seat out on the terrace.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:43.620
Well? Amazing, don't you think?

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:45.840
What is this place?

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:49.630
It was created when someone's
experiment went awry.

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:53.080
They call it Washu's Pore.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.920
Pore?

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.520
Well, eat up, Seina-kun.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:58.950
R-Right!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.890
Thanks for the food!

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.690
It's delicious, Airi-san!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.440
Really? Then please eat a lot!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:16.490
I will!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:26.550
Yamada Seina,

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:28.410
I challenge you to a duel!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.960
Even if you did undergo body enhancement, you're still an uncivilized louse!

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:34.920
I absolutely will not give Amane up to–

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.000
Where should I send your package?

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:48.570
Freeze it, then send it to the
farthest-away unexplored planet

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:51.340
within delivery range.

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.980
Thank you for your patronage!

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.610
Do you think he's going to be alright?

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.830
That's it. You're doing good, little boy.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:13.340
I had no idea controlling my
strength would be this hard.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.900
Seina-kun's really
trying hard, isn't he?

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.920
Elma...

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:22.670
With the way he's progressing, I
think he'll grow used to it very soon!

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.310
There's no need to worry.

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:29.770
I should tidy up Seina-chan's room!

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:36.880
What do you say we call it a day?

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:40.030
You don't want to overstrain
yourself on the very first day.

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:41.820
Y-Yes...

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:44.020
Thank you.

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:48.080
Your muscles must be
pretty exhausted too.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:51.080
They'll need a good, long massage...

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.540
Let's go then...

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:07.890
Oh, yes!

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:13.100
Seina-chan, I'll give you a massage,
so come up to your room!

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:15.690
He's... gone?

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.070
That's so strange...

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:21.590
Probabilistic anomalies usually
follow Seina-kun wherever he goes,

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:24.700
but he hasn't had any
bad luck at all today...

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:29.870
I'm fine now, I can do
the rest on my own...

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:35.080
No, if we don't do something about
this now, you'll regret it tomorrow.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:36.580
B-But...

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:38.610
Okay. Now sit up.

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:39.710
I'll do your arms next.

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:49.970
Kiriko-san!

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:51.900
Hey there, Kiriko!

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:52.890
N-No, it's not what you think!

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:56.260
Why don't we give Seina a massage together?

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:56.260
I don't know what you think we did, but we didn't...

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:03.360
That still can't balance
things out, though...

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:21.680
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:21.680
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:26.800
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:26.800
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.340 --> 00:22:34.010
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.340 --> 00:22:34.010
No matter what you do,

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:36.740
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:36.740
no matter what you do,

00:22:37.010 --> 00:22:41.530
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:37.010 --> 00:22:41.530
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:43.820
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:43.820
that come your way.

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:47.390
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:47.390
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:50.100
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:50.100
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.360 --> 00:22:56.330
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.360 --> 00:22:56.330
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:00.800
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:00.800
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.750
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.750
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:15.370
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:15.370
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:20.450
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:20.450
But all I can see is you,

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:25.970
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:25.970
just the way you are.

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:35.530
Our daily life at Amane's house
has gotten off to a rocky start.

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:37.950
What I've been ordered
to use for my training...

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:40.200
is a rag and a bucket?!

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:42.070
Floor cleaning?!

00:23:42.070 --> 00:23:44.000
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:45.650
Meet the 
Parents
